But if the rumors are true, our new
friend is quite the influential figure.

40
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:11,100
He robs from the rich, a hero who
gives to the poor and powerless.

41
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:17,040
So you're telling me that
guy's a secret badass?

42
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:19,380
Ushimitsu Kozo.

43
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:22,937
I heard that name over and
over in the flower capital.

44
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:24,440
They called him a saint.

45
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,800
Maybe he really is a hero.

46
